Subject: Re: Constraining variance of endogenous latent variable
Message-ID: <SHh0quPtFqM.HQoosvqLv94J@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <SHh0quPtFqM.wt2tS-Do290J@lavaan.groups.google.com>
