With a multiple group model, inspect(fit, "cov.lv <http://cov.lv>") returns a list with a covariance matrix for each group. So use the det() function with each element in the list:

#First group
det(inspect(fit, "cov.lv <http://cov.lv>)[[1]])

#Second group
det(inspect(fit, "cov.lv <http://cov.lv>)[[2]])

#And so on...

